<title>USA: Mercantile Stores Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Stores Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Ohio 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.70		    $2.11</p>
<p> Net			 62,672		   77,584</p>
<p> Revs		     988,145		1,004,253</p>
<p>12  MONTHS  Shr			  $3.30		    $3.35</p>
<p> Net			121,465		  123,248</p>
<p> Revs		   3,030,822		2,944,324</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 ended Feb 1, 1997, includes 13 weeks vs 14 weeks ended Feb 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Year ended Feb 1, 1997, covers 52 weeks vs 53 weeks ended Feb 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Latest year reflects pre-tax charge totaling $12 million, or $0.20 per share, attributable to the adoption of a new accounting standard related to the impairment of long-lived assets. ((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
